      en: ["Al-Musayyib is located approximately halfway between Baghdad and Karbala.", "The Great Musayyib Irrigation Project was initiated in the 1950s.", "The city houses one of Iraq's largest thermal power plants.", "The Al-Musayyib Bridge is a strategic structure over the Euphrates.", "The region is a major producer of dates and citrus fruits.", "The city administratively belongs to the Al-Musayyib district in the Babil Governorate."],
