      en: ["Baiji houses the largest oil refinery in Iraq.", "The city is located on the strategically important Baghdad–Mosul railway line.", "The Baiji refinery has a capacity of over 300.000 barrels per day.", "Baiji is located within the so-called 'Sunni Triangle' of Iraq.", "The Baiji thermal power plant is one of the country's most vital.", "The city was liberated in 2015 after intense combat operations."],
      es: ["Población aprox. 200.000", "200 km al norte de Bagdad", "Refinería más grande desde 1985 (310.000 barriles/día)", "Central térmica de 1.500 MW", "Mandato británico 1920-1932", "Era de Saddam 1979-2003", "Dominio del EI junio 2014 - octubre 2015", "Refinería destruida al 70% en la guerra contra el EI"],
      pt: ["População aprox. 200.000", "200 km a norte de Bagdá", "Maior refinaria desde 1985 (310.000 barris/dia)", "Central térmica 1.500 MW", "Mandato Britânico 1920-1932", "Era de Saddam 1979-2003", "Domínio do EI junho de 2014 - outubro de 2015", "Refinaria 70% destruída na guerra contra o EI"],
